      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-14T20:18:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have a WIP CL for chipsets this would apply to (https://crrev.com/c/6542535), but I don\u0027t think this code would run for non-reven boards. It might be safer to leave it in... or enable the sysprop in place where it would be run chromeOS wide. Let me know what you think",
