      "side": 1,
      "message": "From the comments of the previous CL (aosp/3217591?tab\u003dcomments), it looks like the android maintainers prefers if we can specify the chipset here rather than using sysprop. Do we need this only on a certain chipset or it is needed in some of them?\n\nNote that I don\u0027t object to either of the approaches.",
